      "content": "it's just hard to see how anything actually changes. even if i stay, i'm just a ghost in a world that's already decided i'm a problem. everything is just a cycle of people stepping on each other to get ahead. sometimes i look at the mess and i just think... maybe the only way to actually win is to stop playing the game entirely. like, why fight against an ocean that's just going to swallow you anyway?",
